\subsection{Method \code{validate()}}{
Check the space and list violations. Checks never change
content.
\subsection{Usage}{
\if{html}{\out{<div class="r">}}\preformatted{InterfaceSpace$validate()}\if{html}{\out{</div>}}
}

\subsection{Returns}{
A \code{data.table} with columns \code{check}, \code{row}, \code{note}; zero rows
when the space is well built. Checks: \code{relation_nonendorsed_claim}
